# Curated audio the Unity game plays at runtime (user-curated per stress level, 26 Sep 2026). Tracked so a fresh clone
# plays out of the box and removed clips are removed everywhere. Must stay after the media rules above.
!assets/audio/
!assets/audio/**
!assets/entity_audio/
!assets/entity_audio/**
